  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AU-EU relations: balanced narratives and reality check</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project aims at enriching the Africa-EU formal and informal policy dialogue and better connecting Brussels and Addis based policy makers with practical insights and substantial input co-produced by a core group of African and European think tanks and experts in AU and EU member states.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
